1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Saib hauv hiav txwv tuaj, Pohnpei zoo li ib phab ntsa ntsuab tsaus. Ces huab npog lub ncov roob ua ntej peb txog ntug dej.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Hauv huab ntawd, dej sau saum nplooj, nkag rau av, thiab pib ib txoj kev uas thaum kawg yuav txog pob zeb hiav txwv.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Nws hla roob hluav taws cov pob zeb, hav zoov, teb thiab tej chaw uas ntau tiam neeg tau xaiv los hloov thiab tu.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Qhov no yog Pohnpei, ib kob siab hauv Micronesia, sab hnub poob ntawm Pacific, nyob me ntsis qaum teb ntawm txoj kab nruab nrab ntiaj teb.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Thaum hnov lub npe no, neeg nco txog Nan Madol, lub qub nroog pob zeb ntawm ntug dej. Tiam sis qhov ntawd yog ib tshooj xwb.

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Yuav to taub lub kob, peb yuav saib dav dua ib lub tsev qub, thiab taug tej kev txuas uas ua kom tag nrho qhov chaw nyob taus.

7
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Ua cas ho muaj nag ntau? Hav zoov ua li cas rau cov dej ntawd? Ib sab roob cuam tshuam pob zeb hiav txwv li cas?

8
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Cov lus nug no txuas ua ke. Dej tsis nres ntawm tej ciam uas peb cais ntuj tsim, kev ua teb, keeb kwm thiab neeg lub neej.

9
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Saum toj, caj roob cais av. Hauv qab, kwj dej txuas av. Tib cov nag faib mus ntau phiab dej thiab txuas roob rau hiav txwv.

10
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Ib daim duab khaws tau dej tsaws tsag zoo nkauj. Tiam sis nws qhia tsis tag hav zoov, av, huab cua thiab kev xaiv uas pub dej ntws.

11
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Peb txoj kev pib saum ntoo, nqes thoob lub kob, ces tawm dhau ntug hiav txwv, qhov uas av tseem muaj kev cuam tshuam.

12
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Qhov koob yees duab pom tsis tau hauv av, peb siv qauv piav. Tej qauv ntawd tsis yog qhov tsua tshiab lossis daim ntawv ntsuas tseeb.

13
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Peb kuj yuav nco cov neeg nyob ntawm no. Ib kob ntsuab tsis yog av tsis muaj neeg, thiab tsis yog yav dhau los uas nres lawm.

14
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Tej chaw muaj kev paub, kev sib raug raws kev cai, tsoom fwv niaj hnub thiab kev nco uas ib daim duab dav piav tsis tau.

15
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Cia li nco caj roob uas huab npog. Thaum txog kawg, tus duab ntawd yuav qhia zaj dav dua kev zoo nkauj xwb.

16
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Lub hauv paus kob los ntawm roob hluav taws. Ua ntej muaj hav zoov hnub no, lava tsim pob zeb uas dej thiab huab cua hloov ntxiv.

17
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Qhov ntawd tsis txhais tias roob hluav taws tab tom tawg. Roob pob zeb qub tseem siab zoo nkauj thaum lwm yam hloov nws zuj zus.

18
00:02:50,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Nag nkag tej qhov tawg. Kwj dej khawb kev. Pob zeb cov tshuaj hloov. Qhov hnyav rub tej khoom nqes roob, qee zaum qeeb, qee zaum ceev.

19
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:10,000
Dhau caij ntev, tej txheej txheem no muab pob zeb roob hloov ua caj roob, hav thiab ntau sab nqes uas nroj tsuag npog.

20
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:20,000
Hav zoov ua rau qhov muag pom cov duab ntawd du dua. Ntsuab saum npoo zais tau av uas nyuaj thiab tsis sib xws.

21
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Ib qho chaw pom tau yooj yim yog Sokehs Rock, ze sab qaum teb hnub poob, muaj caj pob zeb sawv siab saum ntug dej.

22
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:40,000
Saib deb, zoo li pob zeb ib leeg qhia tag zaj. Tiam sis dej thiab nroj tsuag ncig qhia tias qhov chaw muaj ntau yam ntxiv.

23
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:50,000
Phab pob zeb qhia kev txawv: ib co tiv taus ntev dua, hos tej qhov tawg thiab chaw tsis ruaj cia dej nkag tau yooj yim.

24
00:03:50,000 --> 00:04:00,000
Tsis txhob saib daim nplaim xwb ces muab hnub nyoog meej. Pob zeb hnub nyoog txawv ntawm lub caij uas ib lub hav tsim.

25
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:10,000
Txhua phab roob ntxhab tsis tas los ib yam. Nyeem qhov chaw yuav xav txog tej nyob ncig, tsis yog xaiv zaj txaus ntshai tshaj.

26
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Saib ze, zaj tseem mus ntxiv. Qhov tawg ua kev rau dej, ib yam tshuaj hloov, ces ib lub noob xuab zeb txav tau.

27
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:30,000
Lub kob tsis yaig tib ceev thoob plaws. Huab cua, pob zeb, qhov ntxhab, nroj tsuag thiab kev cuam tshuam ua rau txhua qhov teb txawv.

28
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:40,000
Ib lub hav nkaum cua thiab caj roob qhib thiaj muaj zaj txawv, txawm nyob ze ib leeg hauv daim ntawv qhia chaw.

29
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:50,000
Qhov txawv pab txiav txim dej sau qhov twg, kev twg taug tau, thiab neeg xaiv qhov twg los cog, ua tsev lossis hla mus.

30
00:04:50,000 --> 00:05:00,000
Ua ntej thawj lub tsev lossis phab ntsa, av twb muaj yam pab thiab yam txwv. Neeg keeb kwm loj hlob hauv lub ntiaj teb hloov ntawd.

31
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:10,000
Tam sim no ntsia saum ntuj. Huab cua sov saum hiav txwv nqa dej noo, thiab lub kob cov roob pab thawb huab cua nce siab.

32
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:20,000
Thaum cua nce siab ces txias, dej pa sau tau ua tej tee. Huab tsim, thiab thaum haum, cov tee poob ua nag.

33
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:30,000
Cua sov hauv zos thiab huab cua loj thoob Pacific kuj tseem ceeb. Roob piav tau ib feem, tsis yog qhia tau txhua hnub yuav los nag.

34
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:40,000
Pohnpei nto moo tias noo thiab nag ntau, tshwj xeeb hauv nruab kob. Tiam sis nag txawv raws chaw thiab raws caij; tsis yog txhua hnub tib yam.

35
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:50,000
Ntug dej tshav ntuj thiab ncov roob zais hauv huab nyob tau tib daim duab. Huab cua tsis zoo ib yam thoob lub kob.

36
00:05:50,000 --> 00:06:00,000
Nag ua rau ib lub hav tsaus thaum lwm lub tseem tshav ntuj. Qhov txawv cuam tshuam kwj dej, av, nroj tsuag thiab neeg txoj kev npaj.

37
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:10,000
Huab kuj hloov yam peb paub thaum tuaj saib. Caj roob uas daim duab tsis pom tsis tau ploj ntawm lub kob.

38
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:20,000
Qhov no yooj yim to taub, tiam sis nco peb tias daim duab khaws ib lub caij xwb, tsis yog qhia txhua yam nyob li ntawd mus li.

39
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:30,000
Thaum nag txog saum ntoo, txoj kev faib. Ib co nyob saum nplooj, ib co rov ua pa, ib co ntws nqes rau av.

40
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:40,000
Ib co dej raws ceg thiab cev ntoo. Ib co poob ncaj rau qhov khoob. Hav zoov faib ib nthwv nag ua ntau txoj kev me.

41
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:50,000
Tej kev ntawd hloov caij thiab qhov chaw dej txog. Lawv tsis ua nag ploj, thiab tsis cog lus tiv thaiv txhua zaus dej nyab.

42
00:06:50,000 --> 00:07:00,000
Thaum nag loj lossis los ntev, av puv dej thiab kwj nce ceev tau. Chaw uas paub zoo kuj hloov txawv ua rau tsis paub lawm.

43
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:10,000
To taub nag tsis yog paub qhov nruab nrab xwb. Nag ntev npaum twg, loj npaum twg, los qhov twg thiab yav tas los los li cas puav leej tseem ceeb.

44
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:20,000
Pas dej nyob twj ywm tom qab tshav ntuj tsis qhia tias kwj yuav zoo li cas thaum saum hav tab tom los nag loj.

45
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:30,000
Qhov no yog thawj kev txuas: huab cua ntawm ib sab kob hloov lwm qhov tau, ua ntej cov neeg ntawd pom nag los.

46
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:40,000
Hauv qab ntoo muaj ntau txheej teeb: nplooj saum nplooj, hmab, nroj fern, cag thiab tej nplaim ntub dej.

47
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:50,000
Txhua txheej tsim chaw me txawv. Ntxoov ntxoo, av noo, tshav thiab chaw nyob txawv ntawm hauv av, cev ntoo thiab ceg siab.

48
00:07:50,000 --> 00:08:00,000
Nroj tsuag nyob saum lwm tsob ntoo tej zaum tsuas siv ua chaw tuav. Pom saum ceg tsis tau txhais tias nws tab tom ua mob tsob ntoo.

49
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:10,000
Ntxhuab thiab nroj fern ua hav zoov zoo li qub heev. Tiam sis qhov muag pom xwb qhia tsis tau txhua thaj keeb kwm thiab kev noj qab nyob zoo.

50
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:20,000
Ib co chaw los ntawm kev loj hlob ntev. Lwm qhov muaj keeb kwm ua teb, siv, rov hlob lossis raug cuam tshuam uas qhua tsis paub.

51
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:30,000
Pohnpei hav zoov muaj txoj sia tshwj xeeb ntawm kob. Kev cais deb tsim kev yoog txawv, tiam sis kuj ua ib co tsiaj yooj yim raug teeb meem.

52
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:40,000
Tsis tas tsim ib tug tsiaj tsawg rau txhua daim duab. Ib nplooj xwb qhia tau chaw nkaum, kev noj mov thiab dej txoj kev.

53
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:50,000
Hauv av, nplooj poob nkag lwm lub voj. Cov kab mob thiab tsiaj me zom khoom qub, pab xa tej zaub mov rov rau yam tseem muaj sia.

54
00:08:50,000 --> 00:09:00,000
Cag thiab cov muaj sia hauv av hloov av tus qauv. Dej nkag qhov khoob, ntws hauv av lossis txuas ntxiv saum npoo.

55
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:10,000
Txoj kev twg muaj ntau nyob ntawm av, qhov ntxhab, nag yav tas thiab kev cuam tshuam. Tsis muaj ib txoj kav hauv av ris dej tag nrho lub kob.

56
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:20,000
Daim qauv txiav sab piav cov kev no tau, tiam sis tseem yog qauv. Cov dej tiag taug kev txawv raws txhua qhov chaw.

57
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:30,000
Teb cog mov noj kuj nyob hauv zaj no. Txiv qhob cij, txiv maj phaub, qos thiab lwm yam txuas tsev neeg rau av thiab caij nyoog txoj kev paub.

58
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:40,000
Vaj muaj ntoo thiab hav zoov saib deb zoo sib xws. Lub hom phiaj thiab keeb kwm txawv tau, txawm ib co haujlwm ntuj tsim sib pab.

59
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:50,000
Vim li ntawd yuav saib kom zoo. Ntsuab xwb qhia tsis tau leej twg tu, cog dab tsi, lossis qhov chaw hloov li cas.

60
00:09:50,000 --> 00:10:00,000
Hav zoov yog ib lub cev muaj sia thiab ib feem ntawm neeg lub ntiaj teb. Yuav to taub ib sab, yuav tsum saib lwm sab thiab.

61
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:10,000
Nqes mus, dej sib sau ua kwj meej. Ntau txoj dej me ua ib txoj loj, ris txhua yam uas tshwm saum nws phiab dej.

62
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:20,000
Phiab dej yog av uas xa dej mus rau ib qhov tawm. Caj roob pab faib, hos tej kwj txuas ntau qhov hauv tib phiab.

63
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:30,000
Qhov no yog daim ntawv qhia uas zais hauv toj roob. Kev, av qhib, vaj lossis ntug kwj txuas tau rau tej chaw nyob deb hauv qab.

64
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:40,000
Dej tsaws tsag ua kev txuas pom tseeb thiab zoo nkauj. Ntawm Pohnpei, dej poob yog ib daim duab uas neeg nco ntev.

65
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:50,000
Kepirohi yog ib qho nto moo ze ntug dej sab qab teb hnub tuaj. Nws yog ib feem ntawm nag, dej ntws thiab neeg lub chaw.

66
00:10:50,000 --> 00:11:00,000
Dej tsaws tsag tsis tsim dej tsis txawj tas ntawm nws tus kheej. Nws vam tej kev pub dej, thiab tej ntawd hloov tau.

67
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:10,000
Theem pob zeb ua chaw rau dej poob. Qhov hnyav rub dej nqes, hos tus duab kwj coj dej poob thiab nchos dej mus.

68
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:20,000
Hauv qab, lub pas zoo li nyob twj ywm txawm dej tseem hla. Daim duab ntsiag to tsis txhais tias lub voj dej nres.

69
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:30,000
Dej kuj nqa khoom: noob av me, nplooj, tej tshuaj yaj, thiab tej zaum tej thooj loj thaum dej muaj zog txaus.

70
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:40,000
Ib feem yog av txoj kev hloov li qub. Muaj av hauv dej ntau tsis cia li ua pov thawj tias yog ib yam uas neeg ua xwb.

71
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:50,000
Tiam sis av do thiab kev dej raug hloov ntxiv khoom uas dej nqa tau. Qhov chaw thiab lub caij txiav txim kev cuam tshuam hauv qab.

72
00:11:50,000 --> 00:12:00,000
Yuav tshawb kwj pos huab, saib nag tsis ntev no, tej xwm saum hav, rov saib ntau zaus thiab piv rau qhov uas ib txwm tshwm.

73
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:10,000
Ib txoj dej daj tsis piav tag lub kob kev noj qab nyob zoo. Ib hnub dej ntshiab kuj tsis ua pov thawj tias tsis muaj teeb meem.

74
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:20,000
Rau tus qhua, yuav mloog neeg hauv zos, hwm chaw tso cai thiab tsis mus ze kwj phom sij thaum huab cua hloov.

75
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:30,000
Rau zaj loj, qhov tseem ceeb yog kev txuas. Tus dej yog kev sib txuas tsis tu ncua ntawm av siab thiab ntug hiav txwv.

76
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:40,000
Ntawm ntug dej, dej tshiab ntsib dej qab ntsev. Tus ciam txav thiab sib xyaw raws dej nce nqis, dej ntws thiab tus duab ntug.

77
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:50,000
Ntawm tej ntug nkaum nthwv haum, ntoo mangrove nyob. Cov cag thiab av nkos tsim chaw txawv ntawm hav zoov saum roob.

78
00:12:50,000 --> 00:13:00,000
Ntoo mangrove pab qeeb dej, tuav ib co av thiab pub chaw nyob. Qhov pab npaum twg nyob ntawm chaw thiab tag nrho txoj kev dej.

79
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:10,000
Lawv tsis yog lim uas kho txhua yam saum hav tau tas li. Hav zoov tus kheej yuav tsum zoo, thiab teeb meem loj tshaj qhov nws ris tau.

80
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:20,000
Ntses me thiab lwm tsiaj siv tau ntug dej nkaum nthwv thaum ib ntu ntawm lawv lub neej. Kev txuas mus dhau kab ntoo uas peb pom.

81
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:30,000
Deb ntxiv, pob zeb hiav txwv pab tsim dej lagun thiab txoj kev los txog kob. Dej txuas tej chaw sib txawv no tas mus li.

82
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:40,000
Coral yog tsiaj muaj sia. Ntau hom vam kev sib pab nrog nroj dej me kawg. Ib lub reef yog zej zog, tsis yog pob zeb kho kom zoo xwb.

83
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:50,000
Teeb, kub txias, dej txav thiab dej zoo cuam tshuam reef txoj sia. Yam tshwm saum av kuj tseem ceeb nrog tej kev hem ntawm hiav txwv.

84
00:13:50,000 --> 00:14:00,000
Av mos ua dej pos huab lossis poob saum npoo tau. Qee yam xwm txheej ua rau teeb tsawg thiab chaw nyob hloov.

85
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:10,000
Tsis tau txhais tias txhua zaus nag ua reef puas. Npaum li cas, thaum twg, ntev li cas thiab qhov twg puav leej hloov qhov tshwm.

86
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:20,000
Ib daim duab zoo nkauj saum ntuj tsis yog kev tshuaj xyuas reef. Xim thiab dej ntshiab xwb piav tsis tag txoj sia.

87
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:30,000
Yuav paub kev hloov, cov tshawb xav tau saib ntev, ntsuas haum thiab neeg hauv zos txoj kev paub uas tus tuaj luv luv tsis pom.

88
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:40,000
Lub tswv yim twb meej: ntug hiav txwv tsis yog phab ntsa uas nres txhua yam cuam tshuam los ntawm av.

89
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:50,000
Ib txoj kev xaiv saum roob nkag tau ib saw kev uas txog ntoo mangrove, dej lagun lossis reef nyob deb.

90
00:14:50,000 --> 00:15:00,000
Taug dej pab peb xav txog saw ntawd. Tej daim duab zoo nkauj nyias nyob ua tej feem ntawm ib lub kob tseem ua haujlwm.

91
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:10,000
Neeg nyob hauv cov kev txuas no ntev lawm. Lawv mus los, cog mov, tsim chaw, tu kev sib raug thiab muab ntsiab rau av.

92
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:20,000
Pohnpei hnub no kuj muaj kev, tsev kawm, chaw nom tswv, khw thiab kev xav tau hloov. Keeb kwm tseem nyob hauv neej niaj hnub.

93
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:30,000
Palikir saum kob yog Micronesia lub nroog nom tswv. Pohnpei zaj muaj tsoom fwv niaj hnub thiab lub neej raws kev cai qub.

94
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:40,000
Kolonia ntawm ntug qaum teb yog lwm qhov tseem ceeb. Lub nroog chaw nkoj nco peb tias hiav txwv txuas kob mus rau sab nraud.

95
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:50,000
Ob lub nroog piav tsis tag kob. Zej zog nyob deb nroog, vaj, hav zoov, ntug dej thiab kev cai sib raug tseem ceeb heev.

96
00:15:50,000 --> 00:16:00,000
Sab qab teb hnub tuaj, Nan Madol ntxiv keeb kwm ntev: kob neeg tsim, kwj dej nce nqis thiab phab pob zeb hluav taws hnyav.

97
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:10,000
Qhov qub nroog txuas rau Saudeleur hwj chim thiab kab ke. Pob zeb qhia neeg sib koom ua haujlwm hauv ntug dej uas muaj ntau yam nyuaj.

98
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:20,000
Nag thiab nroj tsuag tsis tos qhov chaw ua qub mam cuam tshuam. Tej chaw neeg tsim ib txwm xav tau kev tu dej thiab tej yam hlob.

99
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:30,000
Hnub no, tu phab ntsa qub kuj yog tu ib puag ncig thiab kev sib raug kab lis kev cai. Ib lub vaj pob zeb tsis cais ntawm kob.

100
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:40,000
Lwm chaw tseem ceeb tej zaum tsis loj. Ib txoj kev, vaj lossis ntug dej muaj npe khaws tau kev paub uas neeg sab nraud tsis pom.

101
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:50,000
Tsis tas tos lub qub tsev loj mam hwm keeb kwm hauv zos. Lub ntsiab tseem nyob hauv kev ua, kev sib raug thiab chaw uas neeg nco.

102
00:16:50,000 --> 00:17:00,000
Tsis txhob tsim kab ke kom daim duab zoo li tseeb. Kev hwm tej zaum yog sawv qhov chaw tau pom zoo thiab txo lub koob yees duab.

103
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:10,000
Kev nkag yog ib feem ntawm kev sib raug. Nug neeg hauv zos kom yog, mloog lawv, thiab nco tias pom zoo nkauj tsis yog tau cai nkag.

104
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:20,000
Hauv zaj no, qauv thiab duab toj roob pab piav txheej txheem. Peb tsis hais tias rov ua ib qho keeb kwm tau meej tas nrho.

105
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:30,000
Tej chaw qub meej dua thaum saib hauv lub ntiaj teb tseem muaj sia, txuas rau neeg thiab tib cov dej txav ntawd.

106
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:40,000
Kev tu Pohnpei yog dab tsi? Pib ntawm pom av siab, kwj, ntug dej thiab reef txuas dhau tej ciam uas peb ib txwm pom.

107
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:50,000
Tu nroj tsuag, saib av do thiab npaj dej kev puav leej sib txuas. Kho ib qho yuav tsum xav txog tej tshwm ntxiv hauv qab.

108
00:17:50,000 --> 00:18:00,000
Tsis muaj ib txoj kev kho haum txhua roob lossis kwj. Kev txiav txim zoo xav tau paub chaw, zej zog koom thiab pov thawj txog qhov tshwm tiag.

109
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:10,000
Saib ntev muaj nqis: rov yees duab, sau nag, ntsuas dej thiab neeg hauv zos kev paub qhia kev hloov uas qhua luv luv tsis paub.

110
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:20,000
Huab cua ntev thiab xwm txheej loj ntxiv kev hem. Zaj no tsis kwv hnub muaj kev puas tsuaj; peb nug yuav to taub thiab tu tej kev txuas li cas.

111
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:30,000
Qhua pab tau los ntawm txoj kev xaiv me: taug chaw tso cai, tsis thab hav zoov thiab cuab tam, mloog cov neeg saib xyuas qhov chaw.

112
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:40,000
Kev yees duab kuj zoo li ntawd. Tsis txhob ua puas lossis mus phom sij rau dej tsaws tsag, caj roob lossis phab ntsa kom tau duab txaus ntshai.

113
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:50,000
Duab zoo caw neeg saib. Lus piav zoo coj qhov kev saib mus rau tej kev sib raug uas ua kom daim duab ntawd muaj tau.

114
00:18:50,000 --> 00:19:00,000
Tam sim no rov taug qab. Reef txais tej kev cuam tshuam ntawm dej ntug hiav txwv; cov dej ntawd nqa ib feem ntawm zaj hauv kob.

115
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:10,000
Kwj sau zaj los ntawm sab roob, av, vaj thiab hav zoov. Cov chaw ntawd rov teb nag, pob zeb thiab neeg txoj kev xaiv.

116
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:20,000
Huab saum caj roob txuas tib saw nrog phab pob zeb ntawm kwj dej nce nqis thiab coral muaj sia sab nraum hiav txwv.

117
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:30,000
Lawv txuas tab sis tsis zoo tib yam. Txhua qhov muaj xwm, keeb kwm thiab ciam, uas kev saib zoo pab peb to taub.

118
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:40,000
Pohnpei zaj tseem ntxim xav dua thaum kev txuas tshwm. Lo lus nug hloov ntawm peb saib dab tsi mus rau yam ua kom nws nyob taus.

119
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:50,000
Saib hauv hiav txwv tuaj, lub kob rov zoo li phab ntsa ntsuab tsaus. Zaum no, ncov roob zais tsis zoo li qhov kawg ntawm peb qhov muag.

120
00:19:50,000 --> 00:20:00,000
Nws yog qhov pib dua: huab, hav zoov, dej, ntug hiav txwv, reef. Ib lub kob, muaj dej nqa tej kev txuas mus ntxiv.
